ough a double door into the conservatory auditorium. She was going out. I was going in, so I held the door for her. We didn't speak. Just nodded. Years later, I was giving a lecture before the concert in that same auditorium to students, asking me questions mostly. One question was the one you just asked me: how ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7134$4F8A4819-C9B7-4AB7-8633-4CC3AE522AC7", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "266debbe76fd44e3595ea82b699ee89936b201ba", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/28c7e27b63a73c4426771be57b736187/223.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7134$707EBAE4-A843-452E-940C-816CBA3DE277", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "f8926b6b839efb2ed72a2f9a6a37d50b4ed224a5", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 515, "id": "Q515"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7134$F5442276-BAF4-4285-B8FF-60C9692A36E0", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "ffc035cdb5d590554228b3ded2800686af011a07", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 311, "id": "Q311"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7134$5E47082B-CCCC-4861-AC4B-EED87F552EB4", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "f7aadf2d161c27532c50669fa7480a9405b847b6", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 311, "id": "Q311"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7134$74052792-CB7A-44C9-A46B-E81DA6435F15", "rank": "normal"}]}}